{
  "id": "01_4986",
  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "HG ガンダムベース限定 TOLRO-800 -トロハチ-",
    "en": "HG Gundam Base Limited TOLRO-800 -Torohachi-"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 2200,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2023年08月05日 (土)",
    "year": 2023,
    "month": 8,
    "day": 5
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラです。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム UC』より、トルロ社製プチモビルスーツ「TOLRO-800 -トロハチ-」が完全新規造形で登場！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Gundam UC \", the Truro company's petit mobile suit \" TOLRO-800 -Torohachi-\" is now available in a completely new model!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• コックピットハッチはクリアパーツで開閉が可能、コックピット内部は形状を精密に再現。",
      "en": "• The cockpit hatch can be opened and closed using clear parts, and the shape of the inside of the cockpit is precisely reproduced."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩関節レール可動、アームの伸縮ギミック、クローの可動を再現。",
      "en": "• Shoulder joint rail movement, arm extension gimmick, and claw movement are reproduced."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• スラスターノズル、脚部裏面ディティールも再現。",
      "en": "• The details of the thruster nozzle and back of the legs are also reproduced."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各所の可動に加えて、専用のパーツを用いて別売りのアクションベース5と接続し、様々なアクションが再現可能。",
      "en": "• In addition to movable parts, it can be connected to Action Base 5 (sold separately) using special parts to reproduce various actions."
    }
  ],
